This file would contain the NepaliLang logo in PNG format.
For now, this is a placeholder - you would need to create an actual PNG file.

The NepaliLang logo should feature:
- Nepal flag colors (red, blue, white)
- The letters "NP" or "नेपाली" prominently displayed
- Modern, clean design suitable for web and print
- Transparent background for versatility

Recommended sizes:
- 32x32 (small icons)
- 64x64 (medium icons)
- 128x128 (large icons)
- 256x256 (HD icons)
- 512x512 (high-resolution)

You can create this using:
- Adobe Photoshop
- GIMP (free)
- Canva
- Figma
- Online logo generators